function dynamicBankInfo(o){
 if(!o||!['kept','lost','unknown'].includes(o.retention)||['calibrated','matching','sameBank','force','skip','pllChanged'].some(k=>typeof o[k]!=='boolean'))return null;
 let plan;
 if(o.force&&o.skip)plan='conflict';
 else if(!o.matching||o.sameBank&&o.pllChanged)plan='configuration';
 else if(o.skip)plan=o.calibrated&&o.retention==='kept'?'skip-reuse':'no-evidence';
 else if(o.force)plan='forced';
 else if(!o.calibrated||o.retention==='lost')plan='initial';
 else if(o.retention==='unknown')plan='retention';
 else plan=o.sameBank?'same':'different';
 return {plan,txRequired:o.pllChanged,hardwarePermission:false};
}
function dynamicBankText(o){const r=dynamicBankInfo(o);if(!r)return '输入无效：请选择有效保持证据与布尔条件。';const words={conflict:'待核：Force与Skip同时有效，所引正文不足以决定优先级。',configuration:'待核：目标配置/Bank匹配未成立，或“同Bank”与MPLL配置改变的输入冲突。','skip-reuse':'Skip分支：已明确存在匹配且仍有效的目标结果；还需产品配置与请求握手。','no-evidence':'不能据Skip复用：尚未证明目标校准结果存在且保持有效。',forced:'强制当前TX/RX Bank/rate组合重新校准；结果不自动覆盖其它rate。',initial:'初始/重新建立校准结果：目标未校准或保存域已丢失；不能走旧值快速恢复。',retention:'待核：目标曾校准，但保存域及有效标记的保持证据未知。',same:'同Bank恢复路径：P1、rate配置和TX/RX握手仍需完成；本路径无需MPLL停开。',different:'跨Bank恢复路径：P1、MPLL停开及配置握手、恢复目标校准结果，再回P0。'};return words[r.plan]+(r.txRequired?' MPLL设置改变/重新校准后，还要求重新校准依赖它的TX。':'')+' 仅分类2.02a已列规则；不证明硬件可启动、有效位真实或Link Up。';}
function alignmentWindowInfo(o){
 if(!o||typeof o.serdes!=='boolean'||typeof o.enabled!=='boolean'||!Number.isFinite(o.now)||o.now<0||['valid','ready'].some(k=>o[k]!==null&&(!Number.isFinite(o[k])||o[k]<0||o[k]>o.now)))return null;
 if(o.valid===null&&o.ready!==null||o.ready!==null&&o.ready<o.valid)return null;
 if(!o.serdes)return {state:'outside',elapsed:null};
 if(!o.enabled)return {state:'disabled',elapsed:null};
 if(o.valid===null)return {state:'unstarted',elapsed:null};
 const elapsed=(o.ready===null?o.now:o.ready)-o.valid;
 return {state:elapsed===6?'boundary':o.ready!==null?(elapsed<6?'stopped':'late'):(elapsed<6?'waiting':'exceeded'),elapsed};
}
function alignmentWindowText(o){const r=alignmentWindowInfo(o);if(!r)return '输入无效：时间须为同一基准的非负数，事件不能晚于当前时刻；RxReady不能早于PHY有效，未知事件留空。';const w={outside:'所引6µs规则仅覆盖该产品SerDes架构；当前不套用。',disabled:'这项监测已关闭；这不修复实际对齐，也不代表其它定时器关闭。',unstarted:'未观测PHY有效，尚无本窗口起点。',waiting:'窗口内等待RxReady；不能把PHY有效当成Link Up。',stopped:'观察到窗口内RxReady，停止本次观察计时；仍不证明DLL可用。',late:'RxReady在6µs之后才出现，观测间隔超过窗口；硬件后续动作未由本查询定义。',exceeded:'已等待超过6µs且未观测RxReady；继续核实际超时/重试实现。',boundary:'恰好6µs：同拍优先级/计时容差未由所引短节完整定义，保持待核。'};return (r.elapsed===null?'':`观测间隔=${r.elapsed}µs。`)+w[r.state]+' 仅单次、持续有效观察；不模拟失锁重触发和完整校准过程。';}
function dynamicBankExplorer(){const o={retention:'kept',calibrated:true,matching:true,sameBank:true,force:false,skip:false,pllChanged:false};return `<div class="flit-explorer"><div class="flit-controls">${pwrSelect('dbank-retention','保存域与有效标记证据',[['kept','确认保留且可信'],['lost','已丢失'],['unknown','尚未确认']],o.retention)}${[['calibrated','目标配置曾完成校准'],['matching','Bank与目标完整配置匹配'],['sameBank','同Bank内切换'],['force','强制当前TX/RX组合校准'],['skip','请求跳过校准'],['pllChanged','MPLL设置改变/重新校准']].map(([k,t])=>pwrBool('dbank-'+k,t,o[k])).join('')}</div><p id="dbank-result" class="protocol-query-output" aria-live="polite">${esc(dynamicBankText(o))}</p><p>“确认保留”包含对应结果仍有效，不能仅凭AON名称勾选。Force选项不模拟MPLL专用边沿协议；见正文独立小节。</p></div>`;}
