function r70BurstDiagram(){const rows=[['UI','0','1','2','3','4','5'],['净误差e[n]','0','+1','−1','+1','0','0'],['前一项e[n−1]','0','0','+1','−1','+1','0'],['相加残差(mod4)','0','+1','0','0','+1','0']];return `<figure class="note"><figcaption><b>原创模4误差时间线：传播内部相消，边界留下残差</b></figcaption><div class="table-wrap"><table class="generation-table"><tbody>${rows.map((r,i)=>`<tr>${r.map((x,j)=>i===0||j===0?`<th>${esc(x)}</th>`:`<td>${esc(x)}</td>`).join('')}</tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><p>示意只比较净误差代数；+1/−1为模4误差量，不是电压或真实波形。不得由此保证任意DFE突发都只产生两bit错误。</p></figure>`;}
